<title>AUSTRIA: Austria's EVN details 1995/6 profit data.</title>
<headline>Austria's EVN details 1995/6 profit data.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1995/6	 1994/5</p>
<p>    Group operating			   1,209   vs    1,048</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax			     1,484   vs    1,193</p>
<p>    Group net				     667   vs	667</p>
<p>    Group financial result		    275   vs	145</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			   3,143   vs    2,961</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)			   25   vs	 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Energieversorgung Niederoesterreich AG.</p>
<p>    Group sales				11,907   vs   10,979</p>
<p>    Electricity sales			 7,662   vs    7,281</p>
<p>    Gas sales				   3,634   vs    3,132</p>
<p>    District heating sales		    206   vs	146</p>
<p>    Group tax payments			  469   vs	180</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs		   3,029   vs    2,908</p>
<p>    Group depreciation			2,028   vs    1,706</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   2,695   vs    2,775</p>
<p>    Group investment			  2,094   vs    1,952</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
